### Get Contact by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/contact/1

### Get all Contacts
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/contact

### Lookup Contacts
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/contact/lookup

### Create Contact
POST https://localhost:5001/api/biller/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "UserId": "Sample",
  "FirstName": "Sample",
  "Surname": "Sample",
  "Email": "Sample",
  "CellPhone": "Sample",
  "BusinessPhone": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample"
}

### Update Contact
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/biller/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "UserId": "Sample",
  "FirstName": "Sample",
  "Surname": "Sample",
  "Email": "Sample",
  "CellPhone": "Sample",
